depth of the spall or a minimum of three (3) inches, which ever is
greater. The excess concrete shall be removed.  Material chosen to
repair the spalled area shall be mixed and placed in accordance
with the manufactures recommendation. Traffic control shall be
left in place until the material has fully cured and set.

